# The director, first boot: a stand-in victim near the world spawn, a haunt on it, the walker placed
# out of its sight, then a death that goes into the ledger. director.restart.commands checks the
# ledger after a restart and puts every setting changed here back.
# The smoke world's spawn is not forest, so the forest rule is off for the test.
/walkers config debug.standInVictims true
/walkers config director.minForestDensity 0
/walkers director standin add
/walkers director haunt standin-1
/walkers director tick
/walkers director tick
/walkers director tick
/walkers director tick
/walkers director tick
/walkers director status
/walkers director status 1
/walkers director end standin-1 ledger
/walkers director ledger
/walkers director return 1
/walkers furs
/walkers status
